    "created_at": "2016-03-22T12:02:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-22T12:02:34Z",
    "body": "There's also base interfaces like `HTMLMediaElement` which would have to be left without constructors. Not sure if anyone would find that surprising, or if it's a non-issue.\n",
